{"name": "The Regreening", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/a9923e77b3c0acc0feba12e07561d076.avif?t=1785231304\" width=\"1051\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/907d621388a593f4509aa748f5f98d9c.poster.avif?t=1785231304\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/907d621388a593f4509aa748f5f98d9c.webm?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/907d621388a593f4509aa748f5f98d9c.mp4?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Restore the world with your hands, your heart, and just a touch of magic. Watch seeds turn into trees and the desert turn into a green oasis. Feel the change as it happens: warm breezes ripple through freshly sprouted meadows, frogs return to singing wetlands, and it finally rains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/200dfb20823d7c20f0203f82f20a393b.poster.avif?t=1785231304\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/200dfb20823d7c20f0203f82f20a393b.webm?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/200dfb20823d7c20f0203f82f20a393b.mp4?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"61\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/48866c89a95be2855d0d0b9a2bdee02b.webp?t=1785231304\" width=\"1051\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plant &amp; Cultivate:</strong> Discover new seeds, choose which animal habitats to restore, learn powerful plant synergies, and create beautiful living biomes according to your vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recycle &amp; Craft:</strong> Clean up old junk to collect crafting materials and upcycle them into beautiful decorations for your home, or powerful watering systems for your plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Befriend Folklore Spirits: </strong>Meet mythical nature spirits willing to give you mighty abilities in exchange for your help (and maybe a few shiny objects.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy the Fruits of Your Care:\u00a0</strong>Harvest flowers and berries to plant in new areas or to give as gifts to your favourite animals and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8856fc4538756c56bdeb4cc71dbc1119.poster.avif?t=1785231304\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8856fc4538756c56bdeb4cc71dbc1119.webm?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8856fc4538756c56bdeb4cc71dbc1119.mp4?t=1785231304\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/65033684658c91cf8b5887e1c7f333a7.avif?t=1785231304\" width=\"1051\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Stress-free: no timers, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Feel your impact! Everything you do helps nature recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Rich atmosphere: adaptive soundtrack + ASMR-like nature sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Intuitive mechanics with folklore storytelling.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The Regreening is a cozy simulation game about restoring nature in a soilpunk fairytale. Grow plants to create living ecosystems, become friends with ancient spirits, make your own upcycling hub, and hug ALL the animals! Can you transform this deserted world into a joyful home again?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/f607acb72cdd2b5fc22b89a30d0a6af6b834c5be/header.jpg?t=1785231304", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Farming Sim", "Cozy", "Nature", "Animals", "Wholesome"], "developers": "Positive Impact Games", "publishers": "Positive Impact Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3419080", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/FXfRU8yXpL0", "first_seen": 1772751600.0, "review_rank": 1057}